translate brazil ch6sc10_7d2bf794:

#   vx "I am?! Uh… good! I’m glad my nervousness is appreciated."
    vx "Eu sou?! Uh… que bom! Fico feliz que meu nervosismo seja compreendido."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:4798
translate brazil ch6sc10_5b6fc870:

#   vx "I’m really glad you’ve become our A’khan, and that you brought Arugoh here to unite us."
    vx "Fico muito feliz que você tenha se tornado nosso A'khan e que tenha trazido Arugoh aqui para nos unir."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:4800
translate brazil ch6sc10_60780a90:

#   mi "Yeah, there has been a few headbutts over the logistics of housing everyone but…"
