translate brazil ch6sc10_7ee30371:

#   mi "They seem to be settling in alright, we just have to construct more huts so everyone has proper space."
    mi "Eles parecem estar se adaptando bem, só precisamos construir mais cabanas para que todos tenham espaço adequado."

